{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"77d433ad53572b08ab08bf68b6356e478687c1c4a4107b706e5400ad53f66f75"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:1e0e5f819a555ee0e88aad6c23839279897cae23201ef84c3b9c666cae5f96c6","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"His new laptop crashing, particularly with the email client freezing up.","evidence":"[D11:15 | 8:57 pm on 6 October, 2023] Sam: Drawing is cool. I'm still just learning how to draw, but I love expressing myself through writing. It's therapeutic and helps me sort out my feelings. Though, I've been a bit frustrated lately with my new phone. Its navigation app keeps malfunctioning, making getting around a bit of a challenge.\n[D14:1 | 1:50 pm on 17 October, 2023] Sam: Hey Evan! I've been missing our chats. I had quite the health scare last weekend - ended up in the ER with a severe stomachache. Turns out, it was gastritis, which was pretty alarming. It was a wake-up call for me to start prioritizing my health, like adopting a more nutritious diet and getting regular exercise. On top of that, my phone's been giving me a hard time, adding to the stress.","itemId":"urn:uuid:7e1c997c-dbc4-5e02-9367-18a596faebf0","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:d07d6e7f2add7c99a1c0c4a5f3be1cdca41720932d32cd3be730576d45cff308","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What is Sam's persistent problem with his phone?","referenceAnswer":"His new phone malfunctioning, particularly with the navigation app.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"d07d6e7f2add7c99a1c0c4a5f3be1cdca41720932d32cd3be730576d45cff308"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}